  "id": "ledger.apply-order-differs-from-set-order",
  "title": "Apply order is not transaction-set order, and differs by network and protocol",
  "pattern": "The transaction set lists transactions in phases sorted by hash; core applies the classic phase first, then the Soroban phase, each in an order shuffled by the hash of the whole set (TxSetFrame.cpp ApplyTxSorter). The same recipe gives a different apply order on each network and protocol. Readers that number transactions by their position in the set, or assume one order, misattribute results.",
  "caps": [
    "CAP-0063"
  ],
